      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a video demonstrating this issue and a fix that worked for me. https://streamable.com/7s8fvr. First part is just using legacy IK with my IRL height. Second part is using the New IK with the same IRL height. Third part is still using the New IK but with an increased player height and playspace mover.",
