      "mergeID": "62199ccf9eb8e97f7f2e2e67",
      "mergedPostDetails": "If you sit cross legged on the floor, it's MUCH less accurate, and your feet and legs clip through the floor.\nOld IK:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/915325049387483157/946925107706732544/unknown.png\nnew IK:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/915325049387483157/946925027348058152/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-02-25_19-14-13.594.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/220513312335593473/946967317244424243/VRChat_1920x1080_2022-02-25_20-55-26.580.png\nThings I did:\n- Reset my height to be my actual height\n- recalibrated many times\n- Tried all different lock methods\n- Set my height above and below my real height.\n- Completely fresh avatar upload without any weird add-ons to interefere with bone positioning.\nIssue persisted.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[Bug] Cross-legged Bugged with Beta IK",
