      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f5ac7260dfe977b69377847|full_name}: \n\"using the New IK but with an increased player height and playspace mover.\"\nI'm having to do this as well yeah. Before on Legacy IK, my hyenid avatar would line up right with my IRL height, but on beta IK I have to adjust my height settings and also make use of playspace mover to line things up properly again without clipping through the ground.",
